Package: blockr.assistant
Title: An LLM Assistant Extension for 'blockr'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    c(person(given = "Nicolas",
             family = "Bennett",
             role = c("aut", "cre"),
             email = "nicolas@cynkra.com"),
      person(family = "Bristol Myers Squibb",
             role = "fnd"))
Description: Building on the docking layout manager provided by 'blockr.dock',
    this extension hosts an 'ellmer'-powered chat interface alongside a
    'blockr' board. The chat is equipped with tools that allow a large
    language model to inspect and manipulate board state -- adding,
    removing and modifying blocks, links and stacks -- via the same
    update channel used by interactive user actions.
